{"source":"github","project_id":"pkgsite","target":"edgararuiz/pkgsite","id":"pr/9","ref":9,"title":"Updates","description":"- Fixed write_reference() CLI output to use backticks consistently by switching from {.file} to {.code} and wrapping fs_path objects in as.character()\r\n- Fixed See Also function names rendering as plain text in reference pages by forcing useFancyQuotes = TRUE before calling Rd2txt, ensuring the backtick conversion works even when knitr disables fancy quotes\r\n- Created _post-render.R to run downlit after every Quarto build, autolinking function names in rendered HTML\r\n- Updated _quarto.yml with post-render: _post-render.R and site-url so downlit can build correct links\r\n- Rewrote the GitHub Actions workflow to install R, downlit, and pkgsite before rendering, then publish separately\r\n- Extended articles/github-actions.qmd with a full downlit setup section covering the post-render script, _quarto.yml configuration, and workflow dependencies\r\n- Updated README.Rmd installation code to use pak::pak(), added a \"Reference index\" section explaining the three-tier grouping priority, and added \"Customize the pages\" and \"Publishing to GitHub Pages\" sections","published_at":"2026-05-20T21:17:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-20T21:26:58Z","url":"https://github.com/edgararuiz/pkgsite/pull/9","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"edgararuiz","merged_at":"2026-05-20T21:26:58Z","state":"MERGED"}}
